  m_Text: '<b>W / A / S / D:</b> Move Tank

    <b>Left-Click:</b> Shoot

    <b>Right-Click:</b>
    Switch Weapon (Cannon / Shotgun)

    <b>Left-Shift:</b> Sprint / Dash (1.5s
    Cooldown)

    <b>Spacebar:</b> Pause Game


    <b>OBJECTIVE</b>

    Clear
    all enemies in the sector to advance to the next level.


    <b>GEAR UP</b>

    Pick
    up health packs (Red) to restore lives,

    damage boosts (Orange) or shields
    (Yellow) to survive!'
